* Physical Behavioral Model for 74LVC1G14 Inverting Schmitt Trigger
* Pins: 1=A, 2=Y, 3=VCC, 4=GND

.SUBCKT 74LVC1G14 A Y VCC GND

C_IN A GND 4P
R_IN A GND 100MEG

* Inverting Schmitt Threshold (VT+ = 1.8V, VT- = 0.9V)
E_SCHMITT INT_Y GND TABLE { V(A) - V(GND) } = (0, 3.3) (0.9, 3.3) (1.8, 0) (5, 0)

* Output Damping Stage
R_OUT INT_Y Y_NODE 25
C_OUT Y_NODE GND 10P
E_DRIVE Y GND VALUE = { V(Y_NODE) }

.ENDS 74LVC1G14
